# No hardcoding

Do not hardcode:

- routes
- navigation items
- footer links
- metadata defaults
- site settings
- **user-facing UI copy** (labels, buttons, placeholders, aria-labels)

Always use:

- config files (`site.ts`, `paths.ts`)
- shared utilities
- **`UiText` from `src/constants/uiText`** for static UI strings (see `ui-text-constants.mdc`)

Hardcoding leads to inconsistency and must be avoided.
